The bare run could not complete: the first medium vendor hit the 900-second deadline, then three redraws received OpenRouter HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded,” so the harness exited without making a hardness claim. The easy records are real, but the run is incomplete and cannot be shipped as evidence. I’m checking whether this is a per-model provider limit or an exhausted key-wide budget before deciding whether a compliant rerun is possible.
