530:\section{Concluding remarks}
531:Recently, also constant weight codes for~$n$ larger than~$28$ have been studied, see~$\cite{largen}$ and~$\cite{brouwertable}$. We therefore also provide a table with improved upper bounds for~$n$ in the range~$29 \leq n \leq 32$ and~$d \geq 10$ (cf.~Brouwer's table~$\cite{brouwertable}$). Most of the new upper bounds for these cases are instances of~$A_3(n,d,w)$, which can computed by using the block diagonalization of~$M_{2,\emptyset}(y)$ from Section~$\ref{Dempty}$ and from~$M_{3,D}(y)=M_{4,D}(y)$ for~$|D|=1$ from Section~$\ref{D2}$ (use only the blocks for~$t=0$ from this section). The bound~$A_3(n,d,w)$ is in almost all cases equal to the Schrijver bound~$\cite{schrijver}$. 
