The local report has finished cleanly despite a heavily contended host: all gated checks pass, and the pending G9 diagnostic is now represented as `null` rather than a misleading zero difference. I’m doing the final interface and determinism audit now; I will not invent the missing hard-oracle or hint transcripts.
